Implementation checkpoint; lifecycle activation is deliberately not wired yet. Reuse the shared ChangeFeed, v1 selectors and canonical reducers for all annotation views. Add bounded turn/process/child/review captures and exact-profile memory lookup.

Proof: canonical 8-file focused suite: 92 passed. RED/GREEN raw-holder nonpublication and review aggregate-byte limit; four killing mutants cover holder leakage, aggregate byte cap, demand cap and rejected-demand poisoning. Full scripts/check --base origin/main passes with new files staged. Baseline and activation guarantees remain separate; no live performance claim.
